# Checkout Component Implementation

## Security Analysis

**Applicable rules:** §1 (Storage), §3 (Binary Trust), §4 (Deep Links)

**Key decisions:**
- Payment API calls must go through our backend gateway, never directly from the app (§3)
- No credentials or tokens stored in the app bundle (§3)
- Session identity comes from secure storage, not from URL parameters (§4)
- Amount and transaction details validated server-side (§3)

